sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor U as Org Owner
    participant SPA as SiteTrack SPA
    participant EF1 as cashfree-subscription EF
    participant CF as Cashfree API
    participant UPI as UPI app (PhonePe/GPay)
    participant EF2 as cashfree-webhook EF
    participant PG as Postgres (subscriptions)

    U->>SPA: click "Upgrade to Business ₹2,999/mo"
    SPA->>EF1: POST /cashfree-subscription {plan, org_id}
    EF1->>EF1: read CASHFREE_APP_ID + secret from env
    EF1->>CF: POST /pg/subscriptions (signed)
    CF-->>EF1: {subscription_id, authorization_url}
    EF1-->>SPA: {pay_url}
    SPA-->>U: redirect to pay_url

    U->>CF: open Cashfree-hosted UPI page
    CF->>UPI: deep-link "Approve mandate"
    UPI-->>U: confirm in UPI app
    U->>UPI: PIN + approve
    UPI-->>CF: mandate-success
    CF-->>U: redirect back to sitetrackpro.in/billing/return

    par Webhook (async, server-to-server)
        CF->>EF2: POST /cashfree-webhook (event + x-webhook-signature)
        EF2->>EF2: verifyHmacSignature(secret, body)
        EF2->>EF2: applyWebhookEvent(event) → status mapping
        EF2->>PG: UPSERT subscriptions (org_id, status='active', period_end)
        EF2->>PG: INSERT billing_history (org_id, amount, paid_at)
        PG-->>SPA: realtime broadcast: subscriptions row changed
        SPA-->>U: pill flips to "Pro · ACTIVE"
    end
